# 📦 {{ env['ORG'] }} Chocolatey Feed

Welcome to {{ env['ORG'] }}'s personal [Chocolatey](https://chocolatey.org/) package feed. This repository hosts a simple-folder NuGet feed for applications not (yet) published to the community Chocolatey.org repository.

## 🚀 How to Install from {{ env['ORG'] }}'s Chocolatey Feed

Chocolatey simple-folder feeds are read from a local path, so clone this repository first, then add it as a source:

```shell
git clone https://github.com/{{ env['ORG'] }}/{{ env['REPO'] }}
choco source add --name="{{ env['ORG'] }}" --source="%cd%\{{ env['REPO'] }}\chocolatey"
```

Once the source is added, you can install any of the packages listed below:

## 🛠️ Packages

